  * and SMMU support, 2MB is that overlap.  (Well, 4kb is as well, but
  * too small to be practical ;-))
  */
-#define FD_BO_HEAP_BLOCK_SIZE (4 * 1024 * 1024)
+/* Chlorophyll: 512 KB, not 4 MB. Each block is backed and mapped whole, and iOS charges a process for it: a fresh device
+ * held three blocks (12 MB) for a few KB of small buffers, over the 17 MB an idle iconservicesagent may keep (jetsam
+ * InactiveHard). The heap still spans 256 blocks (128 MB of small buffers); larger allocations never come from it. */
+#define FD_BO_HEAP_BLOCK_SIZE (512 * 1024)
 
